  "statement": "Let\n\n\\[A=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\left(\\log _{2}(3)\\right)^{3}-\\left(\\log _{2}(6)\\right)^{3}-\\left(\\log _{2}(12)\\right)^{3}+\\left(\\log _{2}(24)\\right)^{3}\\right)\\]\n\nCompute \\(2^{A}\\).",
